<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Brooklyn Union started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Brooklyn Union started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers analyst Steven Strassberg said he initiated coverage of Brooklyn Union Gas Co with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Fundamental changes occurring within the company should enhance earnings and dividend growth potential. The positive impact of these changes does not appear to be reflected in Brooklyn Union's current stock price,&quot; Strassberg said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1/8 at 27.</p>
</text>
